# kicad-druid 1.2.0 (https://github.com/Cimos/kicad-druid), MIT (LICENSE,
# copied from its archive): fab houses' KiCad design rules. Pinned in
# MODULE.bazel as hdlf_rules_fab pins it. The router comparison
# (//e2e/route_krt_sensor) routes hdlf_example_sensor's board under its
# JLCPCB 2-layer 1 oz rules, the rules that board is made to. Targets use
